768e4421","definition":"A condom.","example":"Condoms ARE available, on the underground market, at the outrageous price of ten dollars a piece! Now, I do not mind paying ten bucks for a good piece, as well as some peace of mind, but even the mere possession of these 'safes' is a disciplinary offense!","pos":"noun","synonyms":["condom","cum catcher","rubber"],"antonyms":["dangerous","hazardous","unsafe"],"collocations":[],"usage":"slang","register":"slang","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/safe#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:ef46b1d6c91c4effd2","definition":"A ventilated or refrigerated chest or closet for securing provisions from noxious animals or insects.","example":"The other room was a kitchen, with an open fireplace, a safe, a dresser and a tin sink, with a tap from the tank outside.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["guarded","invulnerable","OK","out of harm's way","protected","safe and sound","secure"],"antonyms":["dangerous","hazardous","unsafe"],"collocations":[],"usage":"dated","register":"dated","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/safe#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:c3477370ad1c949f3a","definition":"A safety bicycle.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["guarded","invulnerable","OK","out of harm's way","protected","safe and sound","secure"],"antonyms":["dangerous","hazardous","unsafe"],"collocations":[],"usage":"colloquial, dated","register":"colloquial, dated","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/safe#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:fbebc84960142e1364","definition":"To make something safe.","example":"“It just trails behind the pylon until I land, then Cramer rem